    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d149">

                <pb facs="0308" n="216" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg216"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/1601</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Greek Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Roussos</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Aide-Mémoire</hi>
                </p>
                <p>By order of my Government I have the honor to inform you that the chief of
                    Bulgarian propaganda at Berne … called at the Greek Royal Legation at Berne to
                    propose an understanding between Greece and Bulgaria, the result of which would
                    be withdrawal from the Macedonian front.</p>
                <p>He offered the explanation that Bulgaria, surrounded by enemies and fearing
                    subjection to Germany, is seeking friendly support in the Balkans.</p>
                <p>The Royal Government in bringing the foregoing to Your Excellency’s knowledge
                    wishes to declare that Greece will not listen to proposals of a separate
                    understanding with any of our enemies.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d149-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-04-18"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">April 18, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d149-f1" n="3" xml:id="d149-f1-content">
                <p>Acknowledged Apr. 26, with the observation that “The Secretary of State notes,
                    with pleasure, the concluding statement …”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
